,"html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{SN}_R\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a> 中无无限归约链的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全系统性质量化每个起点；不等同于仅有某条终止策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$；$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 使用 [[72-df-normalization-proof]] 中无无限归约链的定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.","display":true}],"bytes":1213,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-strong-normalization|df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-strong-normalization|df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization]]"},{"id":"fe827319be301398","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$。$\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)$ 分别使用 [[72-df-strong-normalization]] 与 [[72-df-confluence]] 的定义。"}],"outgoing":["db757aa1a8cf57f3"]}